OL,3,AHow a civil servant got away with
OL,4,Ajuggling five jobs for so long
OL,5,
OL,6,FAleesha Adams joined a video call with
OL,7,FKashim Chowdhury in May 2023.
OL,9,FHe'd been on sick leave from his job at
OL,10,Fthe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,11,Ffor nearly three months and Adams, his
OL,12,Fline manager, wanted to put a plan in
OL,13,Faction to ease him back into work.
OL,15,FAt the start of the call, Chowdhury was
OL,16,Fcoughing and waving tissues up to the
OL,17,Fcamera in an attempt to show how ill he
OL,18,Fwas. But what really caught Adams'
OL,19,Fattention was how pale he looked.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
